          "snippet": {
            "line": 473,
            "text": "theorem slot_exponential_bound {C S L a t : ℝ}\n    (hC : 0 ≤ C) (hS : 0 < S) (hslot : t - a ≤ L * S) :\n    Real.exp ((C / S) * (t - a)) ≤ Real.exp (C * L)"
